# Verify loop-select resolves from prelude without [include %libdir "async.llt"].
# async.llt was deleted in builtin-privacy-stdlib (S-786); its functions moved to
# stdlib/prelude.llt. This test confirms the name is accessible.
# loop-select requires a live async runtime (channel/select-once builtins), so we
# only verify the binding resolves to a Function — not that it executes a loop.
[type-of loop-select]
=== out
String("Function")
